  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Gluten Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A bestselling, moisturizing lip gloss and lip oil hybrid that delivers a high shine finish without the stickiness, specially formulated for sensitive skin.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Apricot Kernel Oil: Nurtures and soothes lips.</p><p>- Raspberry Seed Oil: Protects lips against damage from free radicals and environmental aggressors.</p><p>- Rosehip Oil: Contains vitamins A and E while promoting cell repair and regeneration.</p><p><br></p><p><strong> Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan, cruelty-free, and gluten-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This vegan lip jelly is a gloss and oil in one made with a unique blend of nurturing oils to soothe</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Swipe on over bare lips or over your favorite lip color for soft, glossy lips.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:</strong><br>\n- Apricot Kernel Oil: Nurtures and soothes lips.<br>\n- Raspberry Seed Oil: Protects lips against damage from free radicals and environmental aggressors.<br>\n- Rosehip Oil: Contains vitamins A and E while promoting cell repair and regeneration.</p><p><br></p><p>Polybutene, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Hydrogenated Polybutene, Prunus Armeniaca (Apricot) Kernel Oil, Ethylene/Propylene/Styrene Copolymer, Octyldodecanol, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Rosa Canina Seed Oil, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Seed Oil, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Butylene/Ehtylene/Styrene Copolymer, Aroma/Flavor, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Tocopherol, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, MAY CONTAIN (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Iron Oxides (CI 77491), Iron Oxides (CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850).</p><br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
